# Bodija Health Hub — client (Vite) configuration
# Copy to .env if you need to override the API target.
#
# The client calls the API using same-origin relative paths (/api/...):
#   - local dev:  forwarded to the Express server via the Vite proxy in vite.config.js
#     (override the proxy target with VITE_API_TARGET, e.g. VITE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:10000)
#   - production: forwarded to the backend by Vercel rewrites in vercel.json
# Most setups do NOT need to set anything here.

# VITE_API_TARGET is read by client/vite.config.js only, not by the app code.
# VITE_API_TARGET=http://localhost:5000
